category: Libs
build-depends: cygport liblz4-devel libzstd-devel libz-ng-devel
sdesc: "Fast, compressed, persistent binary data store library for C (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "C-Blosc2 is the new major version of C-Blosc, and tries hard to be backward
compatible with both the C-Blosc1 API and its in-memory format. However, the
reverse thing is generally not true; buffers generated with C-Blosc2 are not
format-compatible with C-Blosc1 (i.e. forward compatibility is not supported)."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/Blosc/c-blosc2
license: BSD-3-Clause
